Synchronizes the current AppDeploy snapshot `1786862316450` for HAN-44.

Root cause: an existing non-done ST-DOC could be reused solely by clientToken/fingerprint even when its stored page structure was still 7 pages from the previous 15-participant layout. After GROUP_ROWS=14, 100 participants require 8 pages, so Seite 8/8 received no STPG token and rendered `QR nicht verfügbar`, causing preflight to fail.

Fix:
- reuse an existing ST-DOC only when requested pageCount matches stored pageCount;
- require the stored page-record count to match;
- when page definitions are supplied, require each stored expected-PNr set to match the requested logical page;
- otherwise create a fresh ST-DOC with a complete current page-token set;
- update regression QA so Seite 8/8 must contain a real QR/STPG identity and preflight must remain available.

