- never persists React row keys, generated server/domain IDs, comparison/economics/optimizer output, provider state, errors, credentials or pending state;
- restores only structurally valid V1 drafts after mount and reconstructs presentation-only keys locally;
- malformed/unsupported drafts fail closed; failed corrupt-draft cleanup is reported as local-storage unavailable;
- 300 ms autosave writes only when semantic editable state differs from the last read/saved draft;
